{\cf2\f0\fs24     <section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <h2>About StudentHub</h2>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             StudentHub is a comprehensive academic portal designed for college students. It brings together}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             all essential academic tools into one easy-to-use platform. Students can view their courses,}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             track assignments, monitor attendance, check results, and stay updated on campus events ? all}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             from a single place. StudentHub aims to simplify the academic experience and help students}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             stay organized throughout their college journey.}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     </section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     <hr>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     <section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <h2>Our Mission</h2>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             Our mission is to empower students by providing them with the digital tools they need to}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             succeed academically. We believe that when students have easy access to their academic}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             information, they can make better decisions, stay on top of their responsibilities, and}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             focus on what truly matters ? learning and growing. StudentHub is built with students}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             in mind, and we are committed to making education more accessible and manageable for everyone.}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     </section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     <hr>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     <section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <h2>What We Offer</h2>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <ul>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Course Management ? View enrolled courses, schedules, and faculty details</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Assignment Tracking ? Keep track of deadlines, submissions, and grades</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Attendance Monitoring ? Check your attendance records for every subject</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Result Viewing ? Access semester results and grade reports</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Event Discovery ? Stay informed about campus events, workshops, and seminars</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <li>Profile Management ? Update your personal and academic information</li>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </ul>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     </section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24     <hr>}\par
