{\cf2\f0\fs24     <section>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>How do I register for courses?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Visit the Courses page and click on the course you want to enroll in.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>How can I check my attendance?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Go to the Attendance page from your dashboard to view course-wise attendance.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>When are results published?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Results are typically published within 2 weeks after the examination period ends.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>How do I reset my password?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Contact the admin office or use the forgot password link on the login page.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>Can I change my enrolled courses?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Yes, course changes are allowed within the first 2 weeks of the semester.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>How do I contact my professors?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>Visit the Courses page to find faculty contact details.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>What is the minimum attendance requirement?</summary>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <p>A minimum of 75% attendance is required in each course.</p>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         </details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24 }\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24         <details>}\par
{\cf2\f0\fs24             <summary>How do I submit assignments online?</summary>}\par
